<div class="mandarin-pinyin">jiàn</div>


!! Composition
* 刂, a form of 刀 (dāo, knife) — semantic component
* 佥 (qiān in modern Mandarin) — component associated with the phonetic series historically; the modern sounds differ

The traditional form is 劍 (jiàn). Simplification changed the form of the phonetic component; do not assume today's 佥 (qiān) gives an exact pronunciation.

''Word family:'' [[Vocabulary/剑]] and [[Vocabulary/剑法]].


